#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:6
msgid "Launch QElectroTech on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上启动 QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:8
msgid ""
"After installation, QElectroTech can be launched from Windows Start Menu. If"
" the shortcut icon has been created at the desktop during installation, "
"QElectroTech can also be launched from that icon."
msgstr ""
"安装后，QElectroTech可以从Windows Start "
"Menu中启动。如果安装期间在桌面上创建了快捷图标，QEctroTech也可以从该图标中启动。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:10
msgid "Click the Windows **[Start]** button."
msgstr "点击 Windows **[开始** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:11
msgid "Select **All Programs**."
msgstr "选择 **所有程序** 。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:12
msgid "Open **QElectroTech** program group."
msgstr "打开 **QElectroTech** 程序组。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:13
msgid "Click QElectroTech icon."
msgstr "点击 QElectroTech 图标。"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:19
msgid "Figure: Splash screen"
msgstr "图：溅射屏幕"

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:21
msgid "Once QElectroTech has been launched, the main window looks as follow:"
msgstr "QElectroTech推出后，主窗口看起来如下："

#: ../../source/users/basics/launch_windows.rst:27
msgid "Figure: Main window QElectroTech"
msgstr "图：主窗口 QElectroTech"
